{"id":"42d80f2fd93c2116","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive2 Perfect Kernel","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel — ZFC Descriptive2 Perfect Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel — ZFC Descriptive2 Perfect Kernel","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel — ZFC Descriptive2 Perfect Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,K,P\\in V,\\ P,K\\subseteq A\\subseteq X\">\\(X,\\tau,A,K,P\\in V,\\ P,K\\subseteq A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\ \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PerfectKernel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\ \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PerfectKernel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,P)\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,P)\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PerfectKernel}_S(K,A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\land\\forall P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,X,\\tau)\\to P\\subseteq K\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PerfectKernel}_S(K,A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\land\\forall P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,X,\\tau)\\to P\\subseteq K\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The perfect kernel is the greatest perfect subset of a closed set in a Polish space; this avoids assuming that an arbitrary union of perfect subsets is itself closed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Polish}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,K,P\\in V,\\ P,K\\subseteq A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\ \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PerfectKernel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polish}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,P)\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PerfectKernel}_S(K,A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\land\\forall P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,X,\\tau)\\to P\\subseteq K\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1636,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c6ab22ce202551d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1812","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3600401d4adbcbd4","4b3a8629f6a6f868"]}